  "comments": "Summary of rNgog Blo ldan shes rab's mDo sde rgyan gyi don bsdus (ID:4437) based on a 58-folio manuscript from Chos sdings (ID:6258) (See annotation: shog gu nga brgyad chos sding gi phyag dpe nas btus so). \r\nIt is unclear whether this summary is by the compiler, Tho yon ye shes don grub bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan (1792-1855), or an earlier scholar. See <<van der Kuijp 1987 [7FZ3B926]>>: 126, n. 12, <<Kramer 2007 [Q47PVAE6]>>: 110, n. 168.",
